usage: build.py [-h] --baseline BASELINE --compiler COMPILER --linker LINKER
                --output OUTPUT

Compile the source-bound public-gradient HIA overlay with native ABI3 tools.
Python performs deterministic source composition and compiler/linker
transport. The complete actual HIA bodies are checked and executed natively.
No numerical, Tensor, ownership, gradient or optimizer operation executes in
this host code.

options:
  -h, --help           show this help message and exit
  --baseline BASELINE
  --compiler COMPILER
  --linker LINKER
  --output OUTPUT
